==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s (100%) spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**3 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~7.33 seconds<sup>120f~220f</sup>.
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge]]s (100%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Golden Doge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

